<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0F172A', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 80, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 38, background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>模块三 · 培训闭环（朱帅铭）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#06B6D4', marginLeft: 12, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>数据闭环的落点</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '47%', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '12px 16px', background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, borderLeft: '4px solid #06B6D4' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>定位：档案是<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>培训效果的归宿与起点</span>。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 接收模块二的仿真/评分结果，<span style={{ color:'#06B6D4' }}>回写刷新个人档案</span>。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 形成闭环：<span style={{ color:'#3B82F6', fontWeight:'bold' }}>培训(场景推演) → 评估(评分) → 画像(档案) → 再培训</span>。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• profile_service 统一读写，避免数据散落各模块。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>学员每一次操作都被记录，成长轨迹连续可追溯。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '53%', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <svg width='540' height='300' viewBox='0 0 540 300'>
        <defs>
          <marker id='ar18' markerWidth='9' markerHeight='9' refX='7' refY='3' orient='auto'>
            <path d='M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z' fill='#64748B' />
          </marker>
        </defs>
        <rect x='20' y='30' width='150' height='54' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='95' y='54' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>培训</text>
        <text x='95' y='72' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>场景推演</text>
        <rect x='200' y='30' width='150' height='54' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='275' y='54' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>评估</text>
        <text x='275' y='72' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>仿真评分</text>
        <rect x='380' y='30' width='140' height='54' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#8B5CF6' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='450' y='54' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>画像</text>
        <text x='450' y='72' textAnchor='middle' fill='#C4B5FD' fontSize='12'>档案刷新</text>
        <rect x='175' y='200' width='190' height='54' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='270' y='224' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>再培训</text>
        <text x='270' y='242' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>闭环迭代</text>
        <line x1='170' y1='57' x2='200' y2='57' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar18)' />
        <line x1='350' y1='57' x2='380' y2='57' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar18)' />
        <line x1='450' y1='84' x2='320' y2='200' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar18)' />
        <line x1='175' y1='227' x2='95' y2='84' stroke='#8B5CF6' strokeWidth='2' strokeDasharray='5,4' />
      </svg>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 56, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '0 18px', background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(6,182,212,0.16), rgba(139,92,246,0.05))', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(6,182,212,0.35)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>答辩亮点</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17.5, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>谁踩过哪些坑、改了多少，全程可追溯——培训不再「一考了之」，而是持续成长的闭环。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>实战避错系统 · 团队分工</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>18 / 25</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
